    "caption": "The bearish mirror: a bearish engulfing and an evening doji star each add up to a shooting star. That is why Baker only needs the hammer and the shooting star: the multi-candle patterns are the same footprint formed over more time, and the faster single-candle version shows the bigger imbalance."
