    "caption": "Freshness. Left: each return to a zone uses up some of the excess buyers, so the first return is the high-probability trade and a zone gets weaker, not stronger, with every touch. Right: before trusting a zone, scroll left; if the candle that created it was already a return to an older zone (Baker's AKAM example, older zone in violet), it is not fresh."
