    "caption": "Baker's XOM weekly walk-through, redrawn. Buy near A above the $56-59 demand (exit if it breaks); B forms fresh demand and C fresh supply. At D price is back in strong supply: hedge (buy a put, or a zero-cost put/call pair) rather than sell if the gain is still short-term. Buy back near E, hedge again at F, lift the hedge at G (new demand), and close everything at H, the major $92-95 supply."
