    "caption": "Counter-trend swing trade, using the zone from Baker's chart (23.87-24.12). Against the trend he only trades strong zones, and he sells as close as possible to the top of the supply (or buys as close as possible to the bottom of demand) with no confirmation candle. The deeper the entry, the smaller the risk to the same stop, so the reward-to-risk ratio is far higher (target here is illustrative)."
