    "caption": "Polarity: when price breaks through a supply zone it becomes demand (and a broken demand zone becomes supply), just like broken resistance turning into support. Baker's MTH chart shows two separate long entries from the same flipped zone, each with a stop a few cents under it. In the AKAM example the day after the break was 'an extremely low risk, high reward trade at the bottom of the new demand zone'."
