    "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 360\" font-family=\"Inter, system-ui, sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Zone stop vs. ATR stop: what it does to size and ratio\"><defs><marker id=\"bkr31bull\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#22c55e\"/></marker><marker id=\"bkr31bear\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/></marker><marker id=\"bkr31lab\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"/></marker><marker id=\"bkr31acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/></marker><marker id=\"bkr31tl\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#a78bfa\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Zone stop vs. ATR stop: what it does to size and ratio</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Same trade, same $300 risk, three ways to place it</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#22c55e\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">In the zone, at the open</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\">entry 43.25, risk/share $0.16</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"124\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#ef444455\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">1,875 shares</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#22c55e\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">16 : 1</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">After the break back above the zone</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\">entry 43.63, risk/share $0.54</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"198\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#ef444455\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"119\" y=\"211\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">555 shares</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"211\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">~4 : 1 (book: almost 5:1)</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">ATR stop instead of the zone</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\">entry 43.25, risk/share $1.62</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"272\" width=\"243\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#ef444455\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"281\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">185 shares</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">under 2 : 1</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">R:R to exit 1 (45.83)</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"314\" width=\"580\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#94a3b812\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"6\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"331\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The closer the entry to the zone edge, the higher the ratio and the more shares the same risk buys.</text></svg>",
    "caption": "The three stop/entry choices from the chapter, side by side. Aggressive: buy inside the zone at about 43.25 - 16 cents of risk, 1,875 shares, 16:1 to exit 1. Conservative: wait for price to break back above the zone (about 43.63) - 54 cents, 555 shares, still above 3:1. The popular ATR stop (43.25 minus a $1.59 ATR) - $1.62 of risk, only 185 shares and less than 2:1, so the trade would fail Baker's 3:1 rule."
